1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,654
Movies make
ejecting look easy,

2
00:00:01,741 --> 00:00:02,716
but pulling this handle

3
00:00:02,729 --> 00:00:04,034
shrinks your spine
an inch!

4
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:07,252
First, an explosive
cord inside the glass

5
00:00:07,264 --> 00:00:09,446
shatters the canopy
in fifty milliseconds.

6
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,504
Cable garters whip
your legs back,

7
00:00:11,567 --> 00:00:12,754
as a catapult charge

8
00:00:12,767 --> 00:00:14,096
blasts you
up the rails.

9
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,551
Sixteen Gs squash
your spinal discs flat,

10
00:00:17,689 --> 00:00:18,676
shrinking you by two

11
00:00:18,689 --> 00:00:19,960
and a half centimeters!

12
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:22,300
Twin rockets clear
the tail fin,

13
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:23,238
while a drogue chute

14
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:24,490
stops you
from tumbling.

15
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,200
The seat drops
as your chute opens,

16
00:00:27,225 --> 00:00:29,425
leaving you shorter
until gravity resets!
